1
00:00:06,006 --> 00:00:07,966
[beeping]

2
00:00:12,012 --> 00:00:13,930
-[girl 1] See ya.
-[girl 2] See you tomorrow.

3
00:00:14,014 --> 00:00:15,890
[indistinct chatter]

4
00:00:15,974 --> 00:00:17,267
Hmm? Oh.

5
00:00:18,351 --> 00:00:19,769
[Anzu] There's Junta.

6
00:00:19,853 --> 00:00:21,688
He's working hard, as usual.

7
00:00:22,522 --> 00:00:24,858
Maybe I could watch him practice.

8
00:00:24,941 --> 00:00:26,776
Hey. No, wait a minute.

9
00:00:27,277 --> 00:00:28,737
-That's a bad idea.
-Hey!

10
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,405
-[Anzu] I need to avoid anything…
-Mm… Ah!

11
00:00:30,488 --> 00:00:32,449
…that lets Riri plot something
at all costs.

12
00:00:32,532 --> 00:00:33,908
Are you okay?

13
00:00:33,992 --> 00:00:35,785
[Anzu] I could end up dead!

14
00:00:37,328 --> 00:00:38,788
Um… Hm!

15
00:00:44,002 --> 00:00:46,004
[theme music]

16
00:02:09,754 --> 00:02:13,049
#9 GINGER ALE IS A FORCE MAJEURE

17
00:02:13,758 --> 00:02:15,176
[Anzu] Now that I think about it,

18
00:02:15,260 --> 00:02:18,763
the baseball club manager's
actually really cute.

19
00:02:19,472 --> 00:02:22,600
I wonder if he'd ever date
someone like her.

20
00:02:22,684 --> 00:02:25,436
Maybe, if he weren't under Riri's spell.

21
00:02:25,979 --> 00:02:29,858
I feel terrible getting him involved
in this whole messed up situation.

22
00:02:30,525 --> 00:02:31,359
-Here.
-Ah…

23
00:02:31,442 --> 00:02:34,571
[announcer] Your attention, please.
Doors' opening on the right.

24
00:02:34,654 --> 00:02:36,781
-[doors open]
-[Riporin] Huh? Anzu?

25
00:02:36,865 --> 00:02:37,699
Huh?

26
00:02:39,242 --> 00:02:40,410
Yeah, it is.

27
00:02:40,952 --> 00:02:42,662
Amin, Riporin!

28
00:02:42,745 --> 00:02:44,873
Wow, how have you been, Anzu?

29
00:02:45,456 --> 00:02:48,001
We were just talking
about how we should have a reunion.

30
00:02:48,084 --> 00:02:49,627
Really? That'd be fun!

31
00:02:49,711 --> 00:02:51,754
We'll invite whoever we can contact.

32
00:02:51,838 --> 00:02:54,382
[Riporin] Hey, are you busy now?
Let's go have tea.

33
00:02:54,465 --> 00:02:56,217
That sounds great. Let's go!

34
00:02:56,301 --> 00:02:57,302
[Amin] Any ideas where?

35
00:02:57,385 --> 00:02:58,887
Let's do Zarigariya.

36
00:03:00,680 --> 00:03:03,766
[Anzu] Amin, I haven't seen you
since elementary school,

37
00:03:03,850 --> 00:03:06,352
but Riporin, we saw each other
at the station, remember?

38
00:03:06,436 --> 00:03:08,521
Yeah, that was ages ago.

39
00:03:08,605 --> 00:03:11,107
We couldn't even exchange contact info,

40
00:03:11,190 --> 00:03:13,318
because you didn't have a phone back then.

41
00:03:13,401 --> 00:03:15,403
Yeah, my parents waited to get me a phone,

42
00:03:15,486 --> 00:03:17,405
because I would just play games all day.

43
00:03:17,906 --> 00:03:19,824
No way. Well, it's true.

44
00:03:19,908 --> 00:03:22,952
You did spend all of your time
playing video games with the boys.

45
00:03:23,036 --> 00:03:25,830
That's true. And you guys played
some of the scary games.

46
00:03:26,414 --> 00:03:27,832
Oh, like Cat Ranger.

47
00:03:27,916 --> 00:03:31,169
[Anzu] Tonta and I were the only ones
who played it in the beginning.

48
00:03:31,669 --> 00:03:32,879
Tonta?

49
00:03:32,962 --> 00:03:34,589
Oh yeah, he was that, um,

50
00:03:34,672 --> 00:03:37,050
chubby kid with the, the wild hair.

51
00:03:37,133 --> 00:03:40,094
What? I don't remember.
What's his last name?

52
00:03:40,178 --> 00:03:42,013
What? His last name?

53
00:03:42,597 --> 00:03:46,100
Um, Tonta, um, Ton…

54
00:03:46,684 --> 00:03:48,895
You hung out so much,
how could you forget?

55
00:03:48,978 --> 00:03:50,188
[chuckles]

56
00:03:50,271 --> 00:03:53,149
Now let's see.
There was a "mi" in his last name.

57
00:03:53,691 --> 00:03:56,361
Hm, it's… Oh, that's right.

58
00:03:56,444 --> 00:03:57,820
It's Junta Hayami.

59
00:03:58,321 --> 00:03:59,364
What?

60
00:04:00,740 --> 00:04:03,952
[Anzu] What? What?

61
00:04:04,452 --> 00:04:07,372
How awesome, I got it. Hayami, was it?

62
00:04:07,455 --> 00:04:09,666
I wonder what he's up to these days.

63
00:04:09,749 --> 00:04:10,833
Hayami?

64
00:04:10,917 --> 00:04:13,378
Um, well,
I still can't remember that name.

65
00:04:14,504 --> 00:04:17,423
[Anzu] Hey, isn't that
a Cat Ranger character?

66
00:04:17,966 --> 00:04:19,592
Tonta, do you play too?

67
00:04:19,676 --> 00:04:20,969
Huh, mm-hm.

68
00:04:21,052 --> 00:04:23,888
For real? All right, let's play.

69
00:04:24,722 --> 00:04:26,266
I have been wanting to play in team mode

70
00:04:26,349 --> 00:04:29,018
and Ryuya and those guys don't play.
They're so boring.

71
00:04:29,602 --> 00:04:30,853
Come to my place!

72
00:04:30,937 --> 00:04:32,563
What? Really, Miss Hoshino?

73
00:04:32,647 --> 00:04:33,898
Call me Anzu.

74
00:04:34,649 --> 00:04:36,401
Okay, Miss Anzu.

75
00:04:36,484 --> 00:04:38,486
You can leave out the "Miss", okay?

76
00:04:40,655 --> 00:04:41,906
[Anzu] Tonta's…

77
00:04:42,740 --> 00:04:44,117
Junta?
[squealing]

78
00:04:44,200 --> 00:04:46,619
[Riporin] Anzu, you look like
you just ate a bee hive.

79
00:04:46,703 --> 00:04:48,288
[Amin] Do you have a stomachache?

80
00:04:48,871 --> 00:04:52,166
[Anzu] I can't believe how stupid I am.
I could just die.

81
00:04:52,250 --> 00:04:53,793
[both] Well, what happened?

82
00:04:53,876 --> 00:04:57,797
[Anzu] Uh, Tonta wasn't his real name.
It's a nickname.

83
00:04:57,880 --> 00:05:01,050
Jeez, when I think about it now,
it's totally obvious.

84
00:05:01,134 --> 00:05:05,013
I mean, what kind of jerk doesn't know
their friend's real name?

85
00:05:05,096 --> 00:05:07,265
He's not like some rando from online.

86
00:05:07,348 --> 00:05:08,474
[teacher] Next up, Hayami.

87
00:05:08,558 --> 00:05:09,559
Oh, yes.

88
00:05:09,642 --> 00:05:13,229
[Anzu] But to be fair,
Junta has changed dramatically.

89
00:05:13,313 --> 00:05:15,815
He's totally unrecognizable from before.

90
00:05:15,898 --> 00:05:17,066
[both] Anzu?

91
00:05:17,775 --> 00:05:22,155
[Anzu] Tonta, I mean Junta,
goes to the same school as me now.

92
00:05:22,238 --> 00:05:23,781
Oh, really, he does?

93
00:05:23,865 --> 00:05:26,534
Did you forget him
because he's kind of quiet?

94
00:05:27,118 --> 00:05:29,787
Well, he's had a dramatic transformation.

95
00:05:29,871 --> 00:05:32,457
Like an amoeba to an elephant.

96
00:05:32,540 --> 00:05:34,625
[Riporin]
That's like an entirely different species.

97
00:05:35,209 --> 00:05:37,253
Seriously? We have to see him.

98
00:05:37,337 --> 00:05:38,755
Yeah, I'm totally curious.

99
00:05:38,838 --> 00:05:40,423
-[Riporin] Call him!
-[Amin] Call him!

100
00:05:40,506 --> 00:05:43,051
Um… I guess I could give it a try,

101
00:05:43,134 --> 00:05:45,344
but he'll probably be tired from baseball.

102
00:05:51,017 --> 00:05:52,268
Hey, how's it going?

103
00:05:53,686 --> 00:05:54,771
[fork clangs]

104
00:05:54,854 --> 00:05:56,189
Who's this?

105
00:05:56,272 --> 00:05:58,316
You are a different species!

106
00:05:58,399 --> 00:06:01,277
Please be quiet. You're way too loud.

107
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:03,404
Tonta's an athlete now?
[gasps]

108
00:06:03,488 --> 00:06:05,031
And he's hot!

109
00:06:05,114 --> 00:06:08,034
What happened
with all of your signature wild hair?

110
00:06:08,117 --> 00:06:10,286
It's still curly when it grows out.

111
00:06:10,870 --> 00:06:13,456
You're, um, Sayuki and, um, Igawa?

112
00:06:13,539 --> 00:06:14,791
-Riporin.
-Amin.

113
00:06:14,874 --> 00:06:15,958
[both] Be less formal!

114
00:06:16,459 --> 00:06:18,544
-I mean, we can be casual.
-Mm-hm.

115
00:06:18,628 --> 00:06:21,297
[Riporin] We're talking about
having a reunion next Saturday.

116
00:06:21,380 --> 00:06:22,465
[Amin] You'll come, right?

117
00:06:22,548 --> 00:06:24,258
Huh? A reunion?

118
00:06:24,926 --> 00:06:26,552
Anzu, are you gonna go?

119
00:06:27,136 --> 00:06:28,805
Well yeah, I was planning on it.

120
00:06:28,888 --> 00:06:31,265
I can't wait to see everyone's faces.

121
00:06:31,349 --> 00:06:33,768
We need everyone from school to see this

122
00:06:33,851 --> 00:06:36,312
and to understand
that Tonta the bashful, I mean,

123
00:06:36,395 --> 00:06:37,855
Junta, became an athlete.

124
00:06:38,856 --> 00:06:40,399
Sure, if Anzu is.

125
00:06:40,483 --> 00:06:43,778
Oh yeah, I have a game that day
so I might be late.

126
00:06:43,861 --> 00:06:44,904
No prob.

127
00:06:44,987 --> 00:06:46,114
I'm excited.

128
00:06:46,614 --> 00:06:49,158
Are you sure? You're so busy.

129
00:06:49,742 --> 00:06:50,993
Nah, I'll be all right.

130
00:06:51,577 --> 00:06:54,831
But, usually you practice more
once you get home.

131
00:06:54,914 --> 00:06:57,083
And then you walk me back from work too.

132
00:06:57,166 --> 00:06:59,752
So, how long have you guys been dating?

133
00:06:59,836 --> 00:07:00,878
-Huh?
-Huh?

134
00:07:00,962 --> 00:07:03,422
No! It's not like that!

135
00:07:03,506 --> 00:07:06,008
[Amin] It does make sense
that you're with him.

136
00:07:06,092 --> 00:07:08,427
[Riporin] Seriously, girl,
you've got a great eye.

137
00:07:08,511 --> 00:07:11,180
-[Anzu] Are we having fun?
-[Riporin] Oh, chill.

138
00:07:11,264 --> 00:07:13,266
[light music]

139
00:07:14,559 --> 00:07:19,772
[Anzu] This is unbelievable. Junta really
was my childhood friend, Tonta.

140
00:07:19,856 --> 00:07:20,898
So does that mean

141
00:07:20,982 --> 00:07:24,944
it's not just a spell,
and he actually does like me?

142
00:07:25,027 --> 00:07:29,532
[Riri] Junta's had a secret crush on you
since elementary school!

143
00:07:29,615 --> 00:07:30,908
Don't do this to him!

144
00:07:31,659 --> 00:07:33,161
[Anzu] Now that I know…

145
00:07:34,328 --> 00:07:36,038
-Hmm?
-Hmm.

146
00:07:36,747 --> 00:07:38,708
Uh, ugh!

147
00:07:40,209 --> 00:07:43,880
I want to crawl under a rock
of blissful ignorance.

148
00:07:43,963 --> 00:07:46,716
So, um, sounds like
you're a bit overwhelmed right now.

149
00:07:46,799 --> 00:07:47,800
What's going on?

150
00:07:51,721 --> 00:07:52,722
[sighs]

151
00:07:53,764 --> 00:07:55,433
[Riri] Ta-da!

152
00:07:56,017 --> 00:07:59,520
Yay! I am so excited for the reunion!

153
00:07:59,604 --> 00:08:02,607
And don't even think
about wearing your normal frumpy clothes.

154
00:08:02,690 --> 00:08:03,941
I'll pick out your outfit.

155
00:08:06,027 --> 00:08:08,905
[grunts]
What's going on here, Riri?

156
00:08:08,988 --> 00:08:10,948
[chuckles]
Whatever do you mean?

157
00:08:11,032 --> 00:08:11,949
[sighs]

158
00:08:12,575 --> 00:08:14,202
Junta was really Tonta.

159
00:08:14,285 --> 00:08:17,413
I thought he was an old friend
you made up using magic.

160
00:08:18,414 --> 00:08:19,957
-[Riri] You bonehead.
-Huh?

161
00:08:20,041 --> 00:08:23,461
I never ever ever told you
that I made him up now, did I?

162
00:08:24,420 --> 00:08:28,466
You just didn't recognize him at all
because he had transformed so much.

163
00:08:29,091 --> 00:08:33,262
Yeah, but didn't you cast a spell on Junta
so he would fall in love with me?

164
00:08:33,346 --> 00:08:35,973
[Riri] It's not a spell.
I had nothing to do with it.

165
00:08:36,057 --> 00:08:38,309
[Riri] Junta genuinely
has feelings for you,

166
00:08:38,392 --> 00:08:40,561
-and magic isn't even a factor.
-[Anzu] What?

167
00:08:41,062 --> 00:08:44,815
[Riri] Emotional manipulation
of our subjects is absolutely forbidden

168
00:08:44,899 --> 00:08:46,192
-among wizards.
-Huh?

169
00:08:46,275 --> 00:08:49,403
If that were allowed,
I would have cast a spell on you by now.

170
00:08:50,571 --> 00:08:51,531
That's true.

171
00:08:51,614 --> 00:08:55,493
I just shorten the amount of time
it would take for you to reunite.

172
00:08:55,576 --> 00:08:57,245
-What does that mean?
-[chuckles]

173
00:08:57,328 --> 00:09:00,414
[Riri] Well, for example,
at your high school orientation,

174
00:09:00,498 --> 00:09:03,084
Junta saw you
and he even tried to talk to you.

175
00:09:03,167 --> 00:09:04,377
[Anzu] What, he did?

176
00:09:04,460 --> 00:09:06,420
-[Miyoko] Anzu, I'm here. Let's go.
-Huh?

177
00:09:07,588 --> 00:09:10,049
[Riri] However, Miss Gamer,
what do you think you did?

178
00:09:10,132 --> 00:09:13,010
[Anzu] Huh, uh, I don't remember what I…

179
00:09:13,094 --> 00:09:15,805
Why don't we have lunch together
before we head home?

180
00:09:15,888 --> 00:09:19,600
Ah! I needed to use a recovery spell
to win the game!

181
00:09:19,684 --> 00:09:21,769
-Uh, hurry, let's go home.
-What?

182
00:09:21,852 --> 00:09:24,814
[Miyoko] Hey Anzu, what about lunch?
Aren't you hungry?

183
00:09:24,897 --> 00:09:26,566
[Anzu] Finishing the game is priority one.

184
00:09:26,649 --> 00:09:29,110
-[Miyoko] Oh good grief, Anzu!
-[Junta sighs]

185
00:09:30,152 --> 00:09:31,279
[chuckles]

186
00:09:31,362 --> 00:09:32,572
Oh yeah.

187
00:09:32,655 --> 00:09:35,825
I was just about to finish a game,
so I ran home to play it.

188
00:09:35,908 --> 00:09:36,909
That's right.

189
00:09:36,993 --> 00:09:41,122
Splendidly, flawlessly, foolishly,
you completely ignored him.

190
00:09:41,706 --> 00:09:43,583
And once you started school…

191
00:09:44,166 --> 00:09:46,961
you would always rush straight home
as soon as classes ended,

192
00:09:47,044 --> 00:09:48,588
-so you could play your games!
-[gasps]

193
00:09:48,671 --> 00:09:49,880
-[metal clanging]
-[grunts]

194
00:09:49,964 --> 00:09:51,799
[Riri] It was like you were trying
to set a record

195
00:09:51,882 --> 00:09:53,593
for who could get home the fastest.

196
00:09:53,676 --> 00:09:54,594
Uh…

197
00:09:54,677 --> 00:09:56,095
[Riri] And in Junta's case,

198
00:09:56,178 --> 00:09:57,972
he keeps missing the chance
to talk to you,

199
00:09:58,055 --> 00:10:00,182
because baseball has him so busy.

200
00:10:01,434 --> 00:10:02,560
Huh?

201
00:10:03,894 --> 00:10:05,146
[coach] First-years, gather!

202
00:10:08,691 --> 00:10:12,653
[Riri] So I cut off the reunion,
because you two were taking too damn long!

203
00:10:12,737 --> 00:10:14,113
[Anzu] You can't just cut it!

204
00:10:15,698 --> 00:10:18,451
[Riri] All of it is to help you
find love, Anzu.

205
00:10:18,534 --> 00:10:20,244
Ugh, it's none of your business!

206
00:10:20,328 --> 00:10:21,829
-[bones crack]
-I don't care anymore!

207
00:10:21,912 --> 00:10:24,457
Just give me back
my three greatest desires!

208
00:10:24,540 --> 00:10:25,374
[Riri] That hurts!

209
00:10:25,458 --> 00:10:27,084
[in strained voice]
If I do nothing,

210
00:10:27,168 --> 00:10:31,714
then your dictionary will have
no entry included for romance.

211
00:10:31,797 --> 00:10:32,882
[grunts]
I surrender, I surrender.

212
00:10:32,965 --> 00:10:34,383
VIDEO GAMES: VERY FUN. CHOCOLATE:
DELICIOUS. CAT: FLUFFY AND CUTE.

213
00:10:35,092 --> 00:10:38,304
Ugh, could any romance replace
the three things I love most?

214
00:10:38,387 --> 00:10:41,057
But you're the Anti-Heroine,
how could you say that?

215
00:10:41,140 --> 00:10:42,058
Ugh…

216
00:10:42,141 --> 00:10:45,186
[Riri] With girls like you,
we have to be a bit more aggressive,

217
00:10:45,770 --> 00:10:48,314
or you'll keep missing
great opportunities.

218
00:10:48,898 --> 00:10:50,316
[laughing mischievously]

219
00:10:51,025 --> 00:10:53,569
-[Riri] And die alone!
-[Anzu] Jeez, harsh much?

220
00:10:53,653 --> 00:10:56,947
Hold on, why am I the only one
being treated like an outcast?

221
00:10:57,740 --> 00:11:00,076
Saki has no interest in dating either.

222
00:11:00,576 --> 00:11:04,163
[Riri] That's because Saki is
already insanely popular.

223
00:11:04,246 --> 00:11:05,122
[gasps]

224
00:11:05,206 --> 00:11:07,249
[fan] Saki, please, I love you so much!

225
00:11:07,333 --> 00:11:09,126
[Riri] So she won't need help
finding someone.

226
00:11:09,210 --> 00:11:10,252
SAKI LOVE

227
00:11:11,504 --> 00:11:15,007
I'm so sorry, for even considering
I'm in the same league as her.

228
00:11:15,091 --> 00:11:17,385
Now, do you understand it, huh?

229
00:11:17,468 --> 00:11:19,011
What we're doing, Anzu,

230
00:11:19,095 --> 00:11:22,223
is a romantic relationship project
to help you find a love

231
00:11:22,306 --> 00:11:24,767
that surpasses your love
for your greatest desires.

232
00:11:24,850 --> 00:11:26,143
[grumbles]

233
00:11:26,227 --> 00:11:28,437
Well, I say screw that project.

234
00:11:29,647 --> 00:11:32,525
But anyway, even if Tonta is Junta,

235
00:11:32,608 --> 00:11:34,985
the fact remains
that the two of us are just friends.

236
00:11:36,195 --> 00:11:37,071
Heh?

237
00:11:38,114 --> 00:11:39,365
[Riri] Huh?

238
00:11:39,448 --> 00:11:41,117
[Riri] Um, hmm?

239
00:11:41,617 --> 00:11:43,744
[Anzu] Get out!

240
00:11:43,828 --> 00:11:45,871
[Riri] You kick me out now?

241
00:11:50,918 --> 00:11:53,587
Hey, what happened to Tonta?

242
00:11:53,671 --> 00:11:56,048
-[Ryuya] He left already.
-Really?

243
00:11:56,132 --> 00:11:58,843
Oh, I wanted to game with him today.

244
00:11:58,926 --> 00:12:01,595
He told me that he's sick
of playing Cat Ranger.

245
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:02,596
Seriously?

246
00:12:02,680 --> 00:12:05,641
We were just talking about
how we wanted to beat the top score.

247
00:12:05,724 --> 00:12:07,435
You should beat it with us then!

248
00:12:07,518 --> 00:12:09,145
-Yeah!
-[chuckles awkwardly]

249
00:12:09,228 --> 00:12:11,647
You guys didn't even want
to play Cat Ranger before.

250
00:12:11,730 --> 00:12:13,858
-[Katsun] Hey, that's not true.
-[Ryuya sighs, groans]

251
00:12:14,733 --> 00:12:17,153
[indistinct chatter]

252
00:12:17,778 --> 00:12:20,114
Did you say Anzu was coming
to the reunion too?

253
00:12:20,197 --> 00:12:22,700
Anzu? Yeah, she's coming.

254
00:12:22,783 --> 00:12:25,035
Was graduation the last time you saw her?

255
00:12:25,119 --> 00:12:26,036
Yeah.

256
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:29,039
Heh, she'll probably come
in her lame cat clothes.

257
00:12:29,123 --> 00:12:31,542
-[Anzu] You've got a problem with cats?
-[girls] Huh?

258
00:12:31,625 --> 00:12:33,294
-[Ryuya] Anzu?
-Wow.

259
00:12:33,377 --> 00:12:36,922
Look at you, Anzu,
you look so cute, all dressed up.

260
00:12:37,006 --> 00:12:39,091
That's right, girlie. Rock on.

261
00:12:39,175 --> 00:12:40,259
Uh…

262
00:12:40,342 --> 00:12:43,179
Wow, Anzu's got decent clothes on, guys.

263
00:12:43,262 --> 00:12:44,805
And your hair's not everywhere.

264
00:12:44,889 --> 00:12:47,099
I'm really sorry
to disappoint you all, fellas.

265
00:12:47,683 --> 00:12:49,143
[Anzu] But it's only thanks to their help.

266
00:12:49,226 --> 00:12:51,937
I gotta pee! I really gotta pee!

267
00:12:52,021 --> 00:12:53,939
Please just stay still now.

268
00:12:54,023 --> 00:12:56,650
Hey, you forgot to take off the tag.

269
00:12:56,734 --> 00:12:58,611
Just because you changed a little,

270
00:12:58,694 --> 00:13:01,197
doesn't mean you can act
like you're all that.

271
00:13:01,280 --> 00:13:03,824
Clearly, you haven't changed much, Ryuya,

272
00:13:03,908 --> 00:13:04,992
especially your height.

273
00:13:05,075 --> 00:13:07,203
-Hey, I'm still growing, all right?
-[chuckles]

274
00:13:07,286 --> 00:13:09,622
I mean, maybe you just grew too much!

275
00:13:10,956 --> 00:13:13,209
Hey, let's play girls against guys.

276
00:13:13,709 --> 00:13:16,128
The team
with the highest total score wins.

277
00:13:16,629 --> 00:13:19,507
There's more girls than guys,
so that sounds fair, right?

278
00:13:20,132 --> 00:13:22,092
Yeah, I'm in. Sounds like fun.

279
00:13:22,176 --> 00:13:24,094
So, what should the losers have to do?

280
00:13:24,178 --> 00:13:25,804
[girls] What?

281
00:13:25,888 --> 00:13:28,891
How about, losers confess
who their first love was?

282
00:13:29,725 --> 00:13:32,603
Uh-oh, I can only think
of game characters.

283
00:13:32,686 --> 00:13:34,897
[Katsun] We don't expect too much
from you, Bushy.

284
00:13:35,481 --> 00:13:37,358
Well, what should we do?

285
00:13:37,441 --> 00:13:38,484
[worried sigh]

286
00:13:38,984 --> 00:13:40,736
[Anzu] I'm on the girls' team,

287
00:13:40,819 --> 00:13:42,947
so everything is gonna be a-okay.

288
00:13:43,030 --> 00:13:43,864
MASTER OF GAMES

289
00:13:43,948 --> 00:13:44,907
-[chuckling]
-Yeah!

290
00:13:44,990 --> 00:13:48,786
[Anzu] Huh, do you have any idea
what it means to challenge me?

291
00:13:48,869 --> 00:13:52,957
You're all merely average fools!
You have hardly won any games!

292
00:13:53,040 --> 00:13:55,543
I'll make sure
that you all know your place!

293
00:13:55,626 --> 00:13:57,670
-Anzu!
-Yay, Anzu!

294
00:13:57,753 --> 00:14:00,130
You sound just like a villain, girl.

295
00:14:00,839 --> 00:14:03,634
Don't think that this game's
going down like that!

296
00:14:03,717 --> 00:14:05,970
This isn't grade school, you'll be silly!

297
00:14:06,053 --> 00:14:07,137
You mean, "sorry."

298
00:14:07,221 --> 00:14:09,223
[both growl]

299
00:14:09,306 --> 00:14:11,725
[girls cheering]

300
00:14:11,809 --> 00:14:13,727
[Anzu] Nobody realizes

301
00:14:13,811 --> 00:14:15,604
that the secret to winning in bowling…

302
00:14:16,522 --> 00:14:19,567
is that you first have to read
the oil on the lane…

303
00:14:21,819 --> 00:14:23,904
then visualize your target.

304
00:14:25,030 --> 00:14:28,033
And finally, you inject that motivation!

305
00:14:28,117 --> 00:14:31,370
Now, prepare for death!

306
00:14:32,788 --> 00:14:35,332
-[squealing]
-[girls] Strike!

307
00:14:35,416 --> 00:14:37,751
[screaming]

308
00:14:41,130 --> 00:14:44,425
[Anzu] I just got to smash Riri
so many times!

309
00:14:44,508 --> 00:14:46,051
GIRLS' TEAM WIN!

310
00:14:46,135 --> 00:14:49,471
[Anzu] Now, as promised,
tell us who all your first loves were.

311
00:14:49,555 --> 00:14:51,557
FIGHT ON

312
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:53,142
And get down on your knees!

313
00:14:53,225 --> 00:14:54,810
[Katsun] Don't make it worse.

314
00:14:55,477 --> 00:14:56,645
[Sota] Well, what can we do?

315
00:14:56,729 --> 00:14:59,398
-[Sota] Let's sit down, at least.
-[Katsun] Uh, you go first, man.

316
00:15:00,399 --> 00:15:03,360
Um! Mine was… It was Okawa.

317
00:15:03,444 --> 00:15:04,612
[girls] Ooh!

318
00:15:05,154 --> 00:15:06,822
Mine was Yoshida.

319
00:15:06,906 --> 00:15:08,449
[girls laughing]

320
00:15:08,532 --> 00:15:10,701
Mine was Amin.

321
00:15:12,202 --> 00:15:15,456
Huh, who? Me? No way.

322
00:15:15,539 --> 00:15:17,166
It's over!

323
00:15:17,249 --> 00:15:19,460
-[wails]
-Hey, Ryuya, you're next.

324
00:15:19,543 --> 00:15:20,961
[gasps]

325
00:15:21,045 --> 00:15:22,963
Fine. Mine was…

326
00:15:23,047 --> 00:15:25,966
[boy] Yamaguchi, you cool dude,
get a hold of yourself!

327
00:15:26,050 --> 00:15:28,552
[Anzu] Good thing
Junta didn't get here yet.

328
00:15:28,636 --> 00:15:30,971
-I always liked Anzu!
-[chuckles]

329
00:15:31,805 --> 00:15:33,557
-[screams]
-[Sota] Come on, man.

330
00:15:34,058 --> 00:15:35,059
Hey.

331
00:15:35,768 --> 00:15:37,186
My preschool teacher.

332
00:15:37,937 --> 00:15:39,980
[both] You've got to give us
something better than that, dude!

333
00:15:40,064 --> 00:15:41,523
[scoffs]
Damn it!

334
00:15:41,607 --> 00:15:43,525
We won't lose again! Rematch, now!

335
00:15:43,609 --> 00:15:45,194
Again, dude? Really?

336
00:15:45,277 --> 00:15:47,446
Yamaguchi's HP is at zero.

337
00:15:48,447 --> 00:15:49,865
[Ryuya] This is revenge!

338
00:15:49,949 --> 00:15:52,618
Come on, guys!
Let's show these girls what we've got!

339
00:15:52,701 --> 00:15:55,162
Sure, guys. I mean,
if you want to look even worse.

340
00:15:55,245 --> 00:15:56,246
[giggling]

341
00:15:56,330 --> 00:15:58,248
[all groan]

342
00:15:58,832 --> 00:16:01,043
Okay then, losers buy ice cream.

343
00:16:01,126 --> 00:16:03,879
Your crushes were less interesting
than I could have imagined.

344
00:16:03,963 --> 00:16:05,297
[groans]

345
00:16:05,381 --> 00:16:08,008
Now you just put his HP in the negative!

346
00:16:08,634 --> 00:16:09,635
[Anzu chuckles]

347
00:16:09,718 --> 00:16:12,054
-[Anzu] Saw this coming?
-[Ryuya groans]

348
00:16:14,640 --> 00:16:17,893
-Yay! Now let's all do karaoke!
-[annoyed grunt]

349
00:16:19,520 --> 00:16:22,106
Anzu, I challenge you to karaoke!

350
00:16:22,189 --> 00:16:23,148
Sure thing.

351
00:16:23,732 --> 00:16:25,275
Ryuya, just let it go, man.

352
00:16:25,359 --> 00:16:26,819
Hey, you know what,

353
00:16:26,902 --> 00:16:29,863
you guys really haven't changed
since grade school.

354
00:16:29,947 --> 00:16:33,367
[Ryuya] ♪ Girl, you know I'm sorry
To be forceful ♪

355
00:16:33,450 --> 00:16:36,787
♪ I promise you a future
Will be wonderful ♪

356
00:16:37,621 --> 00:16:38,497
YOU HAVE A FIRM VOICE.

357
00:16:38,580 --> 00:16:39,873
PRACTICE ADJUSTING THE PITCH
AND AIM FOR A HIGHER SCORE.

358
00:16:39,957 --> 00:16:41,750
All right. Not bad.

359
00:16:41,834 --> 00:16:47,965
♪ And I will decide myself ♪

360
00:16:49,091 --> 00:16:49,925
PITCH AT THE BEGINNING IS PERFECT

361
00:16:50,009 --> 00:16:50,926
IT WOULD BE GOOD
IF YOU TRY TO RELAX MORE

362
00:16:51,635 --> 00:16:54,930
-[Ryuya] No! I don't believe this!
-[girls cheering, laughing]

363
00:16:55,014 --> 00:16:58,600
♪ Oh yeah, I'll never let you go ♪

364
00:16:58,684 --> 00:17:00,102
♪ No, no, no ♪

365
00:17:00,185 --> 00:17:01,687
♪ Please don't try to break my heart ♪

366
00:17:01,770 --> 00:17:03,480
[cheering]

367
00:17:04,398 --> 00:17:06,233
-You're such a sore loser.
-Hmph!

368
00:17:06,316 --> 00:17:07,776
-[slurping]
-[giggles]

369
00:17:07,860 --> 00:17:10,320
Oh come on,
you losing to me is such old news.

370
00:17:10,404 --> 00:17:12,990
[Ryuya] Anzu, you really know
how to piss me off!

371
00:17:13,073 --> 00:17:16,493
Oh, you're one to talk, Ryuya.
You're just a two-timer.

372
00:17:16,577 --> 00:17:19,038
What? You're a two-timer? Really?

373
00:17:19,121 --> 00:17:20,748
[splutters]
Hey, shut up!

374
00:17:20,831 --> 00:17:22,499
[both] Yeah, but it's true.

375
00:17:22,583 --> 00:17:24,001
-[grumbles]
-[Riporin] Oh, come on.

376
00:17:24,084 --> 00:17:27,087
Quit your moping.
Just sing a song with Anzu and cheer up.

377
00:17:27,171 --> 00:17:28,964
Oh, all right, fine.

378
00:17:31,383 --> 00:17:32,843
So, what do you wanna sing?

379
00:17:33,719 --> 00:17:34,595
YOU HAVE A NEW MESSAGE

380
00:17:34,678 --> 00:17:36,972
-[Anzu] Oh, um.
-[phone meows]

381
00:17:38,057 --> 00:17:39,975
Oh, Junta just got here.

382
00:17:40,059 --> 00:17:42,311
-[Anzu] I'll go get him.
-[door opens]

383
00:17:42,895 --> 00:17:45,105
-Remind me who is Junta again?
-[door closes]

384
00:17:45,189 --> 00:17:46,273
Junta is Tonta.

385
00:17:46,774 --> 00:17:49,234
Oh yeah, I vaguely remember him.

386
00:17:49,318 --> 00:17:52,780
Wait, didn't he, like,
move away or something?

387
00:17:52,863 --> 00:17:54,281
Yeah, but then he moved back.

388
00:17:54,364 --> 00:17:57,076
And now he goes to school where Anzu goes.

389
00:17:57,159 --> 00:17:58,577
He had a ball game today.

390
00:17:58,660 --> 00:17:59,995
Ball game?

391
00:18:00,079 --> 00:18:03,165
I don't really remember him
being the athletic type.

392
00:18:03,248 --> 00:18:05,375
[mischievous laughter]

393
00:18:05,459 --> 00:18:07,544
-[both] Oh?
-We're back.

394
00:18:08,837 --> 00:18:11,048
Oh, um. Hey there, everyone.

395
00:18:11,548 --> 00:18:13,467
-[girl] Wow.
-[exclaiming]

396
00:18:14,301 --> 00:18:15,427
[both] Ta-da!

397
00:18:15,511 --> 00:18:18,305
-Here's Tonta!
-Or Junta Hayami!

398
00:18:19,389 --> 00:18:21,016
[all] Huh?

399
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:22,059
HE'S GROWN!

400
00:18:22,142 --> 00:18:24,019
[friends] He's Tonta?

401
00:18:24,561 --> 00:18:26,271
[Yamaguchi] You got way too tall, man!

402
00:18:26,355 --> 00:18:28,482
[girl] I don't recall
you being such a cutie, though.

403
00:18:28,565 --> 00:18:32,945
Wait, are you the Junta Hayami?
Of Shunkan's baseball team?

404
00:18:33,028 --> 00:18:34,404
[Junta] Oh, yeah.

405
00:18:34,488 --> 00:18:36,365
Really? That's so awesome!

406
00:18:36,949 --> 00:18:38,992
Didn't you have an RBI last game?

407
00:18:39,076 --> 00:18:41,537
I, I'm a total
high school baseball nut, dude.

408
00:18:41,620 --> 00:18:45,082
This is amazing. I can't believe
Tonta's a star athlete now.

409
00:18:45,165 --> 00:18:46,625
[Sota] Jeez, can I get your autograph?

410
00:18:47,584 --> 00:18:49,670
-I totally didn't recognize you at all.
-[chuckles]

411
00:18:49,753 --> 00:18:51,463
And you're so tall now.

412
00:18:51,547 --> 00:18:53,048
How tall are you, anyway?

413
00:18:53,132 --> 00:18:55,926
[chuckles nervously]
I don't know, maybe, six one?

414
00:18:56,009 --> 00:18:58,178
You must be popular.
Do you have a girlfriend?

415
00:18:58,262 --> 00:19:00,180
His girlfriend's right over here.

416
00:19:00,264 --> 00:19:02,724
-[liquid splashes]
-I am not!

417
00:19:02,808 --> 00:19:04,268
Oh! The ginger ale stings!

418
00:19:04,351 --> 00:19:07,437
-That's so gross, bro.
-It's not like that.

419
00:19:07,521 --> 00:19:10,107
Well, you and Anzu do make sense.

420
00:19:10,190 --> 00:19:11,942
Yeah, you guys have been friends forever.

421
00:19:12,442 --> 00:19:15,612
[chuckles mockingly]
You guys seriously crack me up.

422
00:19:15,696 --> 00:19:18,740
-Huh?
-Now you wanna be friends with him?

423
00:19:19,449 --> 00:19:22,953
Tonta, you must think
you're so much better than us now.

424
00:19:23,036 --> 00:19:24,746
Oh come on, Ryuya, please don't do this.

425
00:19:25,330 --> 00:19:28,208
I mean, you're tall,
and yeah, you're athletic.

426
00:19:29,084 --> 00:19:31,086
And on top of that, you're tall too.

427
00:19:31,170 --> 00:19:32,671
You said "tall" twice, dude.

428
00:19:33,547 --> 00:19:36,466
You just came to show off
how hot you are now, right?

429
00:19:37,050 --> 00:19:38,177
-[Anzu] So tell me…
-[friends gasp]

430
00:19:39,052 --> 00:19:42,264
Is it so bad that a person
should feel better after improving?

431
00:19:42,347 --> 00:19:43,265
Uh…

432
00:19:43,348 --> 00:19:47,060
[Anzu] Plus, Junta isn't doing
any of it for attention.

433
00:19:47,644 --> 00:19:51,064
He's dedicated and works hard.
He practices 24/7.

434
00:19:52,399 --> 00:19:54,401
So it's not fair to dismiss Junta

435
00:19:54,484 --> 00:19:56,862
and treat him
like he's just another pretty face.

436
00:19:57,779 --> 00:19:59,948
[grumbles]
I'm out.

437
00:20:00,032 --> 00:20:02,409
-What? Huh? Ryuya!
-[door opens]

438
00:20:02,993 --> 00:20:04,244
[door closes]

439
00:20:05,579 --> 00:20:07,831
Sorry guys, I'll be right back.

440
00:20:08,415 --> 00:20:10,250
-[door closes]
-[sighs]

441
00:20:10,334 --> 00:20:12,085
Hold up, Ryuya!

442
00:20:13,378 --> 00:20:15,464
I'm sorry I made a scene, okay?

443
00:20:15,547 --> 00:20:17,341
But I'm leaving, so it's fine now, right?

444
00:20:17,424 --> 00:20:20,469
Ryuya, jeez! Will you knock it off
with the moping!

445
00:20:20,552 --> 00:20:21,970
[grunts]
Hey!

446
00:20:22,971 --> 00:20:24,306
Just so you know.

447
00:20:24,389 --> 00:20:28,143
Not once did I ever feel bored
hanging out with you, Ryuya.

448
00:20:28,227 --> 00:20:29,102
[gasps]

449
00:20:29,186 --> 00:20:31,230
[Anzu] So there's no reason to be jealous.

450
00:20:31,813 --> 00:20:34,942
Just shut up.
And don't try to make me stay.

451
00:20:35,943 --> 00:20:40,072
-Anyway, you must be sick of me, right?
-[Anzu chuckles]

452
00:20:40,155 --> 00:20:43,992
Your wicked, cantankerous attitude
makes you kind of interesting.

453
00:20:44,076 --> 00:20:46,787
You were super devious
when we play games too.

454
00:20:46,870 --> 00:20:50,040
Are those supposed to be compliments?
Jeez, Anzu.

455
00:20:50,916 --> 00:20:54,086
Listen, I know I made it awkward
for you to stay

456
00:20:54,169 --> 00:20:55,545
because of how I spoke up.

457
00:20:56,046 --> 00:20:58,507
But those guys will understand.

458
00:20:59,716 --> 00:21:02,052
And don't worry,
this doesn't make me hate you.

459
00:21:02,135 --> 00:21:03,428
We can still be friends.

460
00:21:03,512 --> 00:21:04,346
[sighs]

461
00:21:04,930 --> 00:21:05,806
[soft chuckle]

462
00:21:06,848 --> 00:21:08,267
[exhales deeply]

463
00:21:08,350 --> 00:21:11,979
Oh man, this is crazy.
You really haven't changed at all.

464
00:21:12,062 --> 00:21:15,732
What? I mean, I'm a little more womanly
at this point, right?

465
00:21:15,816 --> 00:21:17,567
[Ryuya] That's not what I meant.

466
00:21:17,651 --> 00:21:21,321
I didn't think I had feelings anymore
because it's been years.

467
00:21:22,656 --> 00:21:25,742
But I, um, I lied before.

468
00:21:26,493 --> 00:21:28,078
My preschool teacher.

469
00:21:29,204 --> 00:21:32,582
[Ryuya]
My real first love was, it was you.

470
00:21:33,166 --> 00:21:34,376
[all gasp]

471
00:21:34,459 --> 00:21:35,961
I mean, um…

472
00:21:37,337 --> 00:21:39,506
-I still really like--
-Sorry, no way.

473
00:21:39,589 --> 00:21:42,301
[shocked groan]
Hey, at least let me finish!

474
00:21:42,384 --> 00:21:44,052
Sorry, I couldn't hold it in.

475
00:21:44,136 --> 00:21:48,056
Anyway, I'd never be with someone
who'd date two girls at once!

476
00:21:48,140 --> 00:21:51,435
You have a girlfriend, and now
you're telling me that you like me too?

477
00:21:51,518 --> 00:21:53,854
Uh… Uh, but well, we--

478
00:21:54,438 --> 00:21:56,148
we went to different schools, Anzu!

479
00:21:56,857 --> 00:21:57,983
What was I supposed to do?

480
00:21:58,066 --> 00:22:00,277
She was really sweet and she lives close.

481
00:22:00,861 --> 00:22:02,779
[sighs]
Seriously, dude?

482
00:22:02,863 --> 00:22:06,283
But I… I thought about you
the whole time I was with her.

483
00:22:06,366 --> 00:22:09,870
And another girl asked me out
and I thought she'd help me forget you.

484
00:22:10,370 --> 00:22:13,457
Anyway, I messed up.
And I looked like a cheater.

485
00:22:13,540 --> 00:22:15,083
You're a trash bag.

486
00:22:15,167 --> 00:22:18,170
Gah! Thank you for being real.

487
00:22:18,253 --> 00:22:21,715
Gah, but how come
I still like you after all this?

488
00:22:21,798 --> 00:22:24,384
[sighs]
You're cold, you're not sexy.

489
00:22:24,468 --> 00:22:26,303
You shoot ginger ale out of your nose.

490
00:22:26,386 --> 00:22:28,388
The ginger ale was a total act of God.

491
00:22:29,014 --> 00:22:29,931
[Ryuya] Hey.

492
00:22:30,599 --> 00:22:32,893
Do I really not stand a chance?

493
00:22:33,477 --> 00:22:34,603
[Anzu gasps]

494
00:22:36,271 --> 00:22:37,856
I appreciate how you feel.

495
00:22:38,356 --> 00:22:39,524
I really do.

496
00:22:39,608 --> 00:22:41,943
But I wanna be with someone
who wouldn't cheat on me

497
00:22:42,027 --> 00:22:43,487
just because we're apart.

498
00:22:44,821 --> 00:22:47,824
-Do you mean, someone like Tonta?
-[chokes, gasps]

499
00:22:47,908 --> 00:22:50,077
[Anzu] Huh? He totally nailed it!

500
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:53,663
No, not at all. I don't think
Junta sees me like that anyway.

501
00:22:53,747 --> 00:22:55,832
What? Are you really that dumb?

502
00:22:55,916 --> 00:22:58,585
[Ryuya] That's been totally obvious
for eons, Anzu!

503
00:23:00,212 --> 00:23:03,548
Anyway, you and I are friends
and nothing more, Ryuya!

504
00:23:03,632 --> 00:23:06,760
You're too straightforward!
My heart's torn to shreds!

505
00:23:06,843 --> 00:23:08,261
-[girls giggling in distance]
-[both] Huh?

506
00:23:08,345 --> 00:23:10,222
Ryuya just got rejected!

507
00:23:10,305 --> 00:23:12,390
Oh jeez, I couldn't hold it in anymore!

508
00:23:12,474 --> 00:23:15,769
Hey, that's messed up!
Don't laugh about my unrequited love!

509
00:23:16,561 --> 00:23:18,021
Now, I'm ruined.

510
00:23:18,105 --> 00:23:21,149
They already make fun of me
because they know I like you.

511
00:23:21,233 --> 00:23:23,235
[Anzu] It's not like
your first love was a disgrace.

512
00:23:24,152 --> 00:23:26,279
You guys came over
because you were worried, right?

513
00:23:26,363 --> 00:23:27,697
Yeah.

514
00:23:28,532 --> 00:23:31,910
I was worried
because I thought I made you feel bad.

515
00:23:32,452 --> 00:23:34,621
How could you possibly care about me?

516
00:23:34,704 --> 00:23:36,540
Now I feel really petty.

517
00:23:36,623 --> 00:23:38,917
-Well, you should. You are.
-Just shut up!

518
00:23:39,501 --> 00:23:40,585
I'm sorry.

519
00:23:40,669 --> 00:23:42,879
I just got jealous
but don't worry about it.

520
00:23:44,506 --> 00:23:45,841
Anzu got it right.

521
00:23:45,924 --> 00:23:47,884
You did a lot to improve yourself.

522
00:23:48,718 --> 00:23:50,137
That's hella impressive.

523
00:23:50,887 --> 00:23:52,430
[soft chuckle]
Thanks, Ryuya.

524
00:23:52,973 --> 00:23:55,142
[Ryuya] Hey, you don't have
to thank me, dude.

525
00:23:55,225 --> 00:23:56,893
[girls giggling]

526
00:23:56,977 --> 00:23:59,896
[Anzu] All right, let's go back.
Everyone's waiting.

527
00:23:59,980 --> 00:24:03,024
[Riporin] Both Ryuya and Junta?
You're so popular, Anzu.

528
00:24:03,108 --> 00:24:04,860
[Anzu] Junta doesn't feel that way
about me.

529
00:24:05,694 --> 00:24:10,157
[Anzu] I just gotta lean into
the heroine oblivious twist feelings act.

530
00:24:11,449 --> 00:24:12,534
Tonta, wait up.

531
00:24:13,535 --> 00:24:17,247
I actually lied about something
a long time ago.

532
00:24:17,914 --> 00:24:19,124
Hmm?

533
00:24:19,207 --> 00:24:20,417
Hey, Tonta.

534
00:24:20,917 --> 00:24:23,962
Anzu said she doesn't wanna play
Cat Ranger with you anymore,

535
00:24:24,462 --> 00:24:26,590
because she's playing it
with all of us now.

536
00:24:28,717 --> 00:24:29,885
Okay.

537
00:24:29,968 --> 00:24:33,722
[Ryuya] That was how I kept you
from being able to play with her.

538
00:24:34,556 --> 00:24:36,183
And because of that,

539
00:24:36,266 --> 00:24:41,104
you didn't have time to talk to her
and you moved away, shortly after.

540
00:24:42,439 --> 00:24:43,273
I see.

541
00:24:44,608 --> 00:24:45,775
Well, what a relief.

542
00:24:46,276 --> 00:24:49,196
I thought it was because Anzu
didn't wanna play with me anymore.

543
00:24:49,696 --> 00:24:52,782
Come on, man!
Why the hell aren't you mad at me?

544
00:24:52,866 --> 00:24:55,827
Uh, well, it's, it's all
in the past for me.

545
00:24:55,911 --> 00:24:58,038
And anyway,
I get to hang out with Anzu now.

546
00:24:58,121 --> 00:24:58,955
[sighs]

547
00:24:59,539 --> 00:25:02,334
This whole time, you felt guilty about it.

548
00:25:03,084 --> 00:25:05,212
-[Ryuya] This guy's way too nice.
-[chuckles]

549
00:25:05,295 --> 00:25:08,006
Well, I wanna apologize for that too.

550
00:25:08,590 --> 00:25:12,510
Sorry, but it's not like I've given up
on Anzu, all right?

551
00:25:12,594 --> 00:25:14,679
-Well, I, um--
-[Ryuya] You like her, right?

552
00:25:14,763 --> 00:25:15,639
[gasps]

553
00:25:17,557 --> 00:25:20,185
It's totally obvious, man. Let's go.

554
00:25:23,605 --> 00:25:27,484
[all] Ryuya!
Congratulations on your heartbreak!

555
00:25:27,567 --> 00:25:29,361
[Yamaguchi] All right! Let's do a round

556
00:25:29,444 --> 00:25:31,404
where we dedicate
all the heartbreak songs to Ryuya!

557
00:25:31,488 --> 00:25:32,656
[all cheering]

558
00:25:32,739 --> 00:25:33,573
BREAKUP SONG RANKING

559
00:25:33,657 --> 00:25:35,158
[Ryuya] You guys, what?

560
00:25:35,242 --> 00:25:37,452
This is seriously so messed up!

561
00:25:37,535 --> 00:25:38,370
BREAKUP SONG RANKING

562
00:25:39,412 --> 00:25:40,997
A fanfare, please!

563
00:25:41,081 --> 00:25:43,500
And a big congratulations!

564
00:25:43,583 --> 00:25:45,502
Did you fall for my little trick?

565
00:25:45,585 --> 00:25:48,546
I bet now you don't feel like
skipping the ending, right?

566
00:25:48,630 --> 00:25:52,300
In today's world, you can watch
whatever you want at your own convenience.

567
00:25:52,384 --> 00:25:55,053
But don't you think in that process
we've also lost something?

568
00:25:55,136 --> 00:25:57,639
[sighs]
Don't just let things be! Come on!

569
00:25:57,722 --> 00:26:00,100
Let's go on a super-duper happy adventure!

570
00:26:00,183 --> 00:26:02,102
So I can make sure I get paid.

571
00:26:02,185 --> 00:26:04,354
[closing theme music]

572
00:26:04,437 --> 00:26:05,272
♪ Ah, yeah! ♪

573
00:26:07,816 --> 00:26:08,733
♪ Let's go! ♪

574
00:26:10,819 --> 00:26:12,112
♪ Lo-love! ♪

575
00:26:14,489 --> 00:26:15,323
♪ Here we go! ♪

576
00:26:15,407 --> 00:26:18,618
♪ Sorry that I'm forcing you ♪

577
00:26:18,702 --> 00:26:21,871
♪ But I promise you'll enjoy
A wonderful future ♪

578
00:26:21,955 --> 00:26:28,586
♪ No, no to your three greatest needs
Video games, chocolates, and cats ♪

579
00:26:28,670 --> 00:26:31,506
I'll never give myself up to these ikemen!

580
00:26:31,589 --> 00:26:34,968
That's what you say now,
but I know you'll give in eventually!

581
00:26:35,051 --> 00:26:36,678
♪ You! (So!) You too! (So!) ♪

582
00:26:36,761 --> 00:26:38,430
♪ I know your heart is beating fast!
(Show!) ♪

583
00:26:38,513 --> 00:26:41,057
♪ Fall in love, no one can stop love! ♪

584
00:26:41,141 --> 00:26:43,643
♪ Come on
Don't you want to fall in love? ♪

585
00:26:43,727 --> 00:26:44,936
♪ Just admit it ♪

586
00:26:45,020 --> 00:26:46,980
♪ Don't you want to fall in love? ♪

587
00:26:47,063 --> 00:26:48,189
♪ Don't be so stubborn now ♪

588
00:26:48,273 --> 00:26:50,233
♪ Don't you want to fall in love? ♪

589
00:26:50,317 --> 00:26:54,487
♪ You can't stay away
From these ikemen forever ♪

590
00:26:54,571 --> 00:26:56,614
♪ Come on now!
Don't you want to fall in love? ♪

591
00:26:56,698 --> 00:26:58,158
♪ Just leave it to me ♪

592
00:26:58,241 --> 00:27:00,285
♪ Don't you want to fall in love? ♪

593
00:27:00,368 --> 00:27:01,453
♪ Go ahead and lose yourself ♪

594
00:27:01,536 --> 00:27:03,538
♪ Don't you want to fall in love? ♪

595
00:27:03,621 --> 00:27:08,418
♪ You can't stay away
From these ikemen forever ♪

596
00:27:08,501 --> 00:27:09,753
♪ Embrace me, hold me tight ♪

597
00:27:09,836 --> 00:27:11,463
♪ Release your wild side ♪

598
00:27:11,546 --> 00:27:13,048
♪ The sign of love
Only you can pick up on ♪

599
00:27:13,131 --> 00:27:16,051
♪ Let's go romantic! ♪
